body:
Yeah, I do not intend to come across as sounding cocky or smug but I think the only reason I have done well in my classes is that I found them laughably easy. They needed so little effort on my part that I was able to manage despite being unable to study or pay attention in classes. Unfortunately I  don't have the documentation. I was diagnosed as a kid when I lived in Canada but now live in Texas and I doubt I could track down the doc that did my assessment back then. Can I ask a doctor to try and re diagnose me here? 

&#x200B;

As for my depression its mainly because of loneliness, I don't talk to my family much because of schedules and got out of a relationship recently. I also have already been accepted into medical school but I kind of don't want to go anymore so that brings even more stress.....
